	(text_box "Signal flows left to right.  Blue boxes: what is on the wire beside them (frequency | level |\nbandwidth | DC), computed by sim/budget.py for the 10 m bench link with 2 dBi whips (the DSA then at\n5.25 dB, holding the demodulator at -20 dBm); the same numbers as docs/images/block_*.svg.  The DSA\nholds the demodulator at about -20 dBm from 3 m to 3 km." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.3200 24.1300 0) (size 91.4400 10.1600)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "77687a28-4917-753c-4804-08826e8b5d91"))
	(text_box "RX ANT, 50 ohm SMA: 5.8 GHz\n(5.15-5.875 usable) | -53.9\ndBm (1 mV p-p) at 10 m with\nwhips, -49.4 dBm (2 mV p-p) at\n300 m with panels | a CW line;\na flip adds +-100 MHz skirts |\nno DC (1.5 pF block) | ABS MAX\n+1 dBm (the LNA).  With the\nSAW filter + LNA module, 5.8\nGHz version (15 dB assumed)\nahead, keep ITS input under\n-14 dBm" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.1600 80.0100 0) (size 31.7500 22.8600)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 214 236 255 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ecedc1fe-2a8f-90b2-dc57-4b733d7f32ad"))
	(text_box "SKY65404-31: 13 dB, NF 1.0 dB, 10\nmA.  Skyworks' circuit: 0.5 pF shunt\nat RF_IN, 0.6 nH + 100 nF on VCC,\n100 ohm on the enable." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4000 102.8700 0) (size 34.2900 10.1600)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8ff20112-a44f-cfab-6a6c-f03770fde6fd"))
	(text_box "after the LNA: -40.9\ndBm (6 mV p-p) |\nnoise -92.5 dBm in\n100 MHz (NF 1.5 dB):\nSNR 39 dB | DC\nblocked" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 48.2600 82.5500 0) (size 21.5900 12.7000)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
