		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2f23e038-27eb-8a51-ab48-2e140bebd851"))
	(text_box "LO RX MON: the\nsynthesizer's second\noutput; enable it in\nsoftware to look at the LO\n(-4 to +5 dBm)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 260.3500 313.6900 0) (size 25.4000 11.4300)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a420dc05-4190-140e-37ae-27094c37955b"))
	(text_box "RX synthesizer: MAX2871, 5.8 GHz integer-N from the\n25 MHz VCXO (N = 232), RFOUTA differential into the\nADL5380's LO (0 dBm), RFOUTB to the LO RX MON jack.\nIts own LDO, +3V3_PLL_RX.  The Costas loop steers\nthe VCXO, so this whole synthesizer is the loop's\nVCO." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 100.3300 274.3200 0) (size 49.5300 12.7000)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "58483b5f-1d80-2300-2cff-f29e36f40998"))
	(text_box "VC_OFF: DC from the DAC, 1.65\nV = no offset; +-1 V = -+430\nkHz of LO (acquisition sweep)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 469.9000 311.1500 0) (size 30.4800 7.6200)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 214 236 255 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "995d3f41-9fd4-4fb5-0a64-33d9d6b86c37"))
	(text_box "DAC outputs, DC, 0-3.3 V (12\nbit, 0.8 mV): VR_I / VR_Q 0.21\nV (the ladders' centre; also\nthe carrier null) | V_T 1.65 V\n+ Vth/2 | VC_OFF 1.65 V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 471.1700 259.0800 0) (size 29.2100 11.4300)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 214 236 255 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fab5c874-919c-e7b1-e3c5-b2f4e62ab8dd"))
	(text_box "ADC inputs: I_P, Q_P, VC, ERR\nthrough 10k / 100 nF (160 Hz):\naverages, 0-3.3 V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 471.1700 345.4400 0) (size 30.4800 7.6200)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 214 236 255 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "de36f40a-889c-4963-96fc-70ba927571d5"))
	(text_box "MCP4728 (I2C 0x60): A = VR_I, B =\nVR_Q (the TX ladders' references,\n0.21 V: amplitude and carrier null),\nC = Q_OFF_F (the fast Q arm's offset\ntrim, through 100 k), D = VC_OFF (a\nfrequency offset / acquisition\nsweep)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 403.8600 299.7200 0) (size 34.2900 15.2400)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "52ddc73e-4dd0-db8f-b58e-2c9a531181ae"))
	(text_box "ADS1115 (I2C 0x48, 860 SPS): the\naveraged I and Q (lock = I large, Q\nsmall), VC (how far the VCXO is\npulled) and the loop error.  Its\nfour inputs are the nets named at\nthe taps above (I_P, Q_P, VC, ERR)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 469.9000 320.0400 0) (size 33.0200 12.7000)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e8ddde9e-6fa7-03ec-be80-443b4d83c04c"))
